T-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">1. 선발 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 문화 및 어학 연수과정(3개월, 비학위 과정) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2. 선발 인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 약간명</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3. 장학 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"> : 3개월(2014. 3. 12~6. 22)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">4. 장학 조건</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 월생활비 : 150만 루피 (약 15만원) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 왕복항공료</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 숙소 및 식비 제공</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">가. 한국 국적 소지자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">나. 만 21세~30세 미만자 (2014. 3. 1 기준)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">다. 고등학교 졸업 이상자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">라. 예술분야의 소양을 갖춘 자, 특히 예술계 학생이나 인도네시아 문화 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">소양을 갖춘 자 우대 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">마. 신체 건강자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">6. 지원 서류</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">가. 지원서 A, B (첨부1-1, 2, 사진 첨부)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">나. 지도교수 등 관련 인사의 추천서 (영어 혹은, 인도네시아어) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">다. 졸업증명서 (영어, 해당자)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">라. 성적증명서 (영어, 최근)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">마. 어학증명서 (소지할 경우 제출, 영어 혹은 인도네시아어)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">바. 여권 사본 (여권 유효기간 10개월 이상 필요)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" styl